HIGHEST POWER FIRST IS THE ORDER DECODE WANTS: X⊥P EVALUATES
P AT X BY HORNER'S RULE, AND THAT IS WHAT PEVAL DOES, FOR A
VECTOR OF X BY AN OUTER PRODUCT OF POWERS. A LEADING ZERO IS
HARMLESS; RESULTS COME BACK WITHOUT ONE, AND A ZERO
POLYNOMIAL IS ,0.

PMUL IS THE OUTER PRODUCT OF THE COEFFICIENTS SUMMED ALONG
ITS DIAGONALS. PDIV AND PREM ARE LONG DIVISION. PROOTS
SAMPLES THE POLYNOMIAL AT 401 POINTS ACROSS THE RANGE THE
ROOTS MUST LIE IN, BISECTS EVERY SIGN CHANGE, AND RUNS
NEWTON'S METHOD FROM EVERY POINT FOR A ROOT THAT TOUCHES
WITHOUT CROSSING; IT GIVES EACH ROOT ONCE, TO SIX PLACES,
ASCENDING. ROOTS CLOSER THAN 1E¯3 ARE TAKEN AS ONE, AND A
REPEATED ROOT IS FOUND ONLY ROUGHLY, SINCE THE VALUE OF THE
POLYNOMIAL BESIDE IT IS LOST TO ROUNDING; NO COMPLEX ROOTS,
SO X*2+1 GIVES AN EMPTY VECTOR. PSHOW WRITES WHOLE
COEFFICIENTS EXACTLY AND OTHERS TO THREE PLACES.

